{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jMPV3YN8RG1794472378.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>特區政府早上舉行孫中山先生誕辰160周年紀念儀式。行政長官李家超指，紀念孫中山最好的方式，是傳承其振興中華的精神，政府會持續深化愛國主義教育。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205925-%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E5%80%A1%E5%82%B3%E6%89%BF%E5%AD%AB%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E6%8C%AF%E8%88%88%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%A8%B1%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%B0%87%E6%8C%81%E7%BA%8C%E6%B7%B1%E5%8C%96%E6%84%9B%E5%9C%8B%E4%B8%BB%E7%BE%A9%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>李家超倡傳承孫中山振興中華精神　稱政府將持續深化愛國主義教育</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府修訂《教育條例》，引入教師執業證書要求等，相關條例草案明日刊憲。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205948-%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E4%BF%AE%E8%A8%82%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%A2%9D%E4%BE%8B%E5%BC%95%E5%85%A5%E6%95%99%E5%B8%AB%E5%9F%B7%E6%A5%AD%E8%AD%89%E6%9B%B8%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E7%AD%89%E5%91%A8%E4%BA%94%E5%88%8A%E6%86%B2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>政府修訂《教育條例》　引入教師執業證書要求等周五刊憲</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，繼續由鄺港傑作供，指案發當日回到龍尾村，蔡天鳳已無任何反應，又稱當時自己應該報警。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205926-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E4%BE%9B%E7%A8%B1%E6%A1%88%E7%99%BC%E7%95%B6%E6%97%A5%E5%88%B0%E9%BE%8D%E5%B0%BE%E6%9D%91%E6%99%82%E8%94%A1%E5%B7%B2%E7%84%A1%E5%8F%8D%E6%87%89%E7%A8%B1%E7%95%B6%E6%99%82%E6%87%89%E8%A9%B2%E5%A0%B1%E8%AD%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港傑供稱案發當日到龍尾村時蔡已無反應　稱當時應該報警</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205951-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%8F%90%E6%9C%80%E7%B7%8A%E8%A6%81%E4%BF%82%E6%B7%A5%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E7%A8%B1%E8%A6%8B%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E5%B0%87%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%80%A1%E5%85%A5%E8%86%A0%E7%AE%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜ 有人提「最緊要係淥」　鄺港傑稱見鄺球將蔡天鳳「瀡入膠箱」</strong></a></p><p></p><p>廉政公署落案起訴啟德醫院一名電工分判商外勞「工頭」，涉嫌收取外勞逾7萬元賄款。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205913-%E5%BB%89%E7%BD%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%A8%B4%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E9%9B%BB%E5%B7%A5%E5%88%86%E5%88%A4%E5%95%86%E5%A4%96%E5%8B%9E%E5%B7%A5%E9%A0%AD%E6%B6%89%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%96%E9%80%BE7%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E8%B3%84%E6%AC%BE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>廉署起訴啟德醫院電工分判商外勞「工頭」　涉收取逾7萬元賄款</strong></a></p><p></p><p>立法會三讀通過北都專屬法例《北部都會區發展條例草案》。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205941-%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%83%E4%B8%89%E8%AE%80%E9%80%9A%E9%81%8E%E5%8C%97%E9%83%A8%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%83%E5%8D%80%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E6%A2%9D%E4%BE%8B%E8%8D%89%E6%A1%88%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E7%B0%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%9F%8E%E8%A6%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>立法會三讀通過《北部都會區發展條例草案》　包括簡化城規程序</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:43:59.150068+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":442,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:37:40.849650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:37:16.712059+00:00","content_hash":"a7f6ab7279a547db11820192cdf002da1d8e1d37b56c2618c7b20af746f1c1d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}